@startuml sequence-check-availability
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Sequence — Check availability (UC4a, included in UC4 and UC8)

actor "Customer / Admin" as User
participant "Frontend\n(React SPA)" as FE
participant "REST API\n(FastAPI)" as API
participant "Availability check\n(crud.is_car_available)" as AV
database "Database\n(SQLite)" as DB

User -> FE: Pick dates in the booking form or submit it (UC4),\nor click "Confirm" (UC8)
FE -> API: GET /cars/{id}/availability, POST /reservations/\nor POST /reservations/{id}/confirm
API -> AV: is_car_available(car_id, start, end)
AV -> DB: SELECT first reservation of the car\nWHERE status = CONFIRMED\nAND start_date < requested end\nAND end_date > requested start
note right of DB
  DRAFT and CANCELLED
  reservations are ignored
end note
DB --> AV: reservation / none

alt no overlapping reservation
  AV --> API: true (car available)
else overlapping CONFIRMED reservation found
  AV --> API: false (car not available)
end

API -> API: Continue the calling use case\n(UC4 / UC8) with the result
API --> FE: Result — {available: true / false} for the\nform check, 409 "slot taken" on submit / confirm
FE --> User: See result\n(slot free and the flow continues,\nor "slot already taken" message)
@enduml
